  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed extension, by virtue of its width, scale and siting, provides for an excessively wide addition that lacks subservience to the host dwelling, in particular when viewed from the front elevation. This is considered harmful to the character and appearance of no. 41 Rosslyn Road on its prominent corner position in the streetscene and is therefore contrary to the design objectives of Policy 53 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;/p&gt;"
